# Story

"Where are we, and how did we get here?" The narrative half of memory, for
anyone who wasn't in the room: docs/status.md (now), session-summaries.md
(then), decisions.md (why), lessons.md and warnings.md (watch out),
project-map.md (what's where). Read-only; Markdown rendered.

